{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id140476957"}, "name":{"label":"ShortFirstSlip"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-22T10:48:28-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.5"}, "id":{"label":"14213724763"}, "title":{"label":"Sorry but this app is so tough"}, "content":{"label":"I used to love this app, but if you have any subscriptions to something like Patreon, the app becomes almost unusable. In order to prevent skipping the ads at the start of a show, even purchased shows scrubbing becomes impossible at any point even if you’re subscribed to the show, paying money to not have ads each month. It’s now irrelevant, this app makes subscriptions almost pointless. I love having all my podcasts in one place but this is so disappointing.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
