{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id87780829"}, "name":{"label":"MichaelJubb"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-28T20:24:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2023.4"}, "id":{"label":"14117995951"}, "title":{"label":"No fuss.. It just works"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using for nearl 10 years now, and it just works. Every time. \nNo glitches.  Can’t recommend T highly enough. Now if I can just find another 5 hours in my day to listen to all thes great podcasts!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id332172228"}, "name":{"label":"is_aka_konor"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-24T17:16:28-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.4.1"}, "id":{"label":"14102479005"}, "title":{"label":"The auto download is still broken"}, "content":{"label":"I've been struggling for months with this bug. Deleting the app\n\nI’m being a paid subscriber for years I cannot be more disappointed than now. The quality of the app is decreasing through the years.\nNot the app has a completely broken streaming feature. Podcast are not loaded properly before hand. When streaming starts it goes only for 1 minute and I have to restart playback every minute. That makes the app unusable while driving\nI deeply regret that I renewed the subscription this year. Apple Podcasts work much more reliably", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id121003593"}, "name":{"label":"Tpidd"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-24T07:28:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.4.1"}, "id":{"label":"14100792143"}, "title":{"label":"Better than the stock app"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve now been using overcast for 4+ years and it’s by far the best app for podcasts. There are soooo many great features that have been built into this app, from custom playlists, to being able to alter speed and priority of each individual podcast, just to name a couple.\n\nTBH, there have been times where this app made me want to throw my phone at the wall, but considering it’s still one person building this thing, they seems to take feedback and get things fixed relatively quick. \nCurrently we are on a streak of it being somewhat flawless. \n\nI’m currently bouncing between using this and Amazon music (it’s included in a subscription), simply because a few of my podcasts are add free there, but the amazon app is absolute garbage. I think I’m just going to deal with the ads.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id198499099"}, "name":{"label":"Insight Applied"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-15T17:27:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.4.1"}, "id":{"label":"14069048235"}, "title":{"label":"Beautifully practical"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve used it every day for years. It works.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1078750311"}, "name":{"label":"AnonEnginr"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-08T20:57:52-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.4.1"}, "id":{"label":"14043841532"}, "title":{"label":"Better than Spotify and Pocketcasts"}, "content":{"label":"I don't write reviews for apps often. But finding a functional podcast app has been a surprising challenge even though we're 20 years into the smartphone era.\n\nOvercast's signature features for me are\n- One swipe to download a podcast\n- Search with good results (rather than just aggregating individual searches for space separated words, I can't believe other apps use this)\n- Reasonable data usage (Pocketcasts ate 3.5GB in 4 hours, and other users have reported this issue since 2024)\n- To my knowledge, doesn't support genocide or Palantir\n\nThank you Overcast team for some fresh air in a polluted ecosystem :))", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
