{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id39066839"}, "name":{"label":"Parmy111"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-14T13:23:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.4"}, "id":{"label":"13958202182"}, "title":{"label":"Michael"}, "content":{"label":"The app isn’t doing anything. It doesn’t load podcasts, doesn’t search podcasts and doesn’t show anything on my Home Screen. It’s like a shell and nothing more. It used to be brilliant but now I just have blank screens", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id46274454"}, "name":{"label":"PepperCherry"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-27T17:47:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.12"}, "id":{"label":"13894445719"}, "title":{"label":"Issues with CarPlay and Patreon"}, "content":{"label":"I uninstalled the app this week.  Had only used the app while driving to listen to subscribed podcasts from Patreon. It was terrible at maintaining current episodes and would require I either remember to open the app and sort out the queue rather than seamlessly moving to the next episode.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id124113053"}, "name":{"label":"Vladimir Noobokov"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-21T20:02:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.12"}, "id":{"label":"13873688328"}, "title":{"label":"The best there is"}, "content":{"label":"I realise everyone's needs are different when it comes to podcasting, but as far as I am concerned nothing comes close to Overcast:\n1. It's the only podcast app that manages my complicated podcasting habits, allowing me to follow a huge number of podcasts, queue them up in playlists, and download them through a complicated set of ad blocking filters and VPNs.\n2. Unlike most apps these days, Overcast does what it does while utterly respecting both my privacy and my devices (including their storage space and their batteries). To say I am thankful for that is an understatement.\n3. Regular updates keep the app at the forefront of what's expected from a podcast app.\nI'll sum up by saying I'm a very happy paid subscriber!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
