{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id106492846"}, "name":{"label":"EKSTAP"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-21T16:21:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11.1"}, "id":{"label":"13425791749"}, "title":{"label":"Fantastic app!"}, "content":{"label":"I don’t think I have ever left a review for an app before - but Overcast is so consistently great, with frequent improvements in response to customer feedback, that it felt like just being willing to pay for it wasn’t enough. Though to be clear - you don’t have to pay for it in order for it to be a genuinely better tool than apples native option. Well done team!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
