{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id24399255"}, "name":{"label":"Not my Sobriquet"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-19T16:01:25-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11"}, "id":{"label":"13418297490"}, "title":{"label":"Want to pay, but subscription only?!"}, "content":{"label":"I love this app - it does all the things I need, and is highly customisable. The free version is also fairly unobtrusive with advertising, which I appreciate. That said, I like to support app developers where I can, and would happily pay a once-off fee for this app if that option was available. \n\nI fundamentally object to software as a service models where there’s no meaningful “service” that’s being delivered outside my own hardware that I’ve already paid for. I get there’s probably some cost to storing my lists of podcasts and currently play positions in the cloud, but I’d also happily pay to have a version of this app that doesn’t rely on online services (other than the podcast directories, and media hosted by the media producers themselves).\n\nPLEASE: offer a one-off payment option and I’ll happily pay it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id125015331"}, "name":{"label":"uglyduckling81"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-11T09:18:28-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11"}, "id":{"label":"13385472385"}, "title":{"label":"App works great"}, "content":{"label":"The app works great. \nThe only issue I have is the subscription to support and remove ads. \nGive us a one off purchase option. I’m never signing up for a subscription but I’d like to remove the ads and support the app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
