{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id961557687"}, "name":{"label":"The best Blake"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-06T00:24:25-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11"}, "id":{"label":"13362758364"}, "title":{"label":"Streaming is back baby!"}, "content":{"label":"I spend a lot of time in this app, and most of the time it’s frictionless, and often improves the podcast finding, listening and management experience. \n\nRecent builds were unreliable streaming, especially when not on wifi, but this is now fixed and it works great even for 2hr15min podcasts on bad 4G!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id42127243"}, "name":{"label":"matthk777"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-05T22:21:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11"}, "id":{"label":"13362470063"}, "title":{"label":"The best Podcast app around - but it's not perfect"}, "content":{"label":"I LOVE this app. After years of dealing with the native Poscast app, this is a joy. But it still needs tweaking. Played, partially played and episodes that failed to download should be easier to see. Auto download of NEXT episode in the series rather than LATEST would make sense, as would the ability to create a playlists of ALL unplayed eps.\n\nALSO: We need a way of RATING podcasts for the creators, as exists with Spotify and the Apple app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
